@startuml clinicalhistory_list_by_company
title GET /clinical-history?from=&to=&types= — List clinical events for the JWT company

actor Client
participant "ClinicalHistoryCompanyController" as Controller
participant "Authz" as Authz
participant "ListCompanyClinicalEventsUseCase\n<<port.in>>" as UseCase
participant "ListCompanyClinicalEventsService" as Service
participant "ClinicalEventRepository\n<<port.out>>" as Repo
participant "JpaClinicalEventRepository" as JpaAdapter
participant "ClinicalEventJpaRepository\n<<spring-data>>" as JpaRepo
participant "ClinicalEventJpaMapper" as Mapper
database "MySQL\n(v_clinical_event)" as DB
participant "GlobalExceptionHandler" as GEH

note over Client, GEH
  AuthFilter ya valido el JWT y puso EmployeeContext en SecurityContextHolder
  antes de llegar al controller. Authz expone currentCompanyId() para que el
  controller NO acepte companyId via path/query (defensa en profundidad).
end note

note over Client, DB
  La vista v_clinical_event UNION-aglutina 9 tablas clinicas filtrando por
  enabled=true en cada rama (migration 071). El JPQL filtra adicionalmente
  por companyId + tipos + rango de fechas.
end note

Client -> Controller : GET /clinical-history\n?types=CONSULTATION,SURGERY,...\n&from=2026-05-01&to=2026-05-31
activate Controller

Controller -> Authz : currentCompanyId()
Authz --> Controller : Long companyId

Controller -> Controller : new ListCompanyClinicalEventsQuery(\n  companyId,\n  types ?? [],\n  from, to\n)\n(record valida que to >= from)

Controller -> UseCase : execute(query)
note right of UseCase
  @PreAuthorize:
  admin.all OR SYSTEM OR @authz.isMyCompany(#query.companyId)
  (cualquier empleado autenticado de la company; defensa en
  profundidad porque el companyId no viene del request sino del JWT)
end note

UseCase -> Service : execute(query)
activate Service

Service -> Repo : findByCompany(query)
Repo -> JpaAdapter : findByCompany(query)
JpaAdapter -> JpaAdapter : types = query.types().isEmpty()\n  ? ALL_TYPES : query.types()
JpaAdapter -> JpaRepo : findByCompany(companyId, types, from, to)
JpaRepo -> DB : SELECT e.* FROM v_clinical_event e\nWHERE e.company_id = ?\n  AND e.event_type IN (...)\n  AND (? IS NULL OR e.event_date >= ?)\n  AND (? IS NULL OR e.event_date <= ?)\nORDER BY e.event_date ASC, e.source_id ASC
DB --> JpaRepo : rows
JpaRepo --> JpaAdapter : List<ClinicalEventViewJpaEntity>
JpaAdapter -> Mapper : toDomain(entity) por cada row
Mapper --> JpaAdapter : List<ClinicalEvent>
JpaAdapter --> Repo : List<ClinicalEvent>
Repo --> Service : List<ClinicalEvent>

Service -> Service : ClinicalEventDto.from(event) por cada
Service --> UseCase : List<ClinicalEventDto>
UseCase --> Controller : List<ClinicalEventDto>
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : toResponse(dto) por cada
Controller --> Client : 200 OK\nList<ClinicalEventResponse>
deactivate Controller

@enduml
